---
import SiteHeader from "$lib/components/SiteHeader.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy: Topology Tools"
  description="Topology Tools runs entirely in your browser. Files you open are never uploaded."
>
  <header class="masthead">
    <div class="masthead-inner">
      <SiteHeader class="masthead-bar" />
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="tagline">
        Topology Tools runs entirely in your web browser. Files you open are processed on your
        device and are never uploaded to us or anyone else.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="page">
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>No accounts, cookies, analytics or tracking.</strong>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Hosting:</strong> the site is served by GitHub Pages. GitHub may log requests
        (including IP addresses) under the{" "}
        <a href="https://docs.github.com/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">
          GitHub Privacy Statement
        </a>
        .
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Third-party requests:</strong> to work, your browser downloads the DuckDB engine
        from cdn.jsdelivr.net, its spatial extension from extensions.duckdb.org, and basemap tiles
        from tiles.openfreemap.org. "Try with demo data" loads files from data.source.coop. If you
        paste a URL, your browser fetches it directly. These services receive normal request
        information such as your IP address. None of them receive the contents of your files.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Stored on your device:</strong> if you turn on offline mode, the app's files are
        saved in your browser's cache, and one setting is saved in local storage. Turning offline
        mode off deletes both.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Questions: open an issue at{" "}
      <a href="https://github.com/OCHA-DAP/topo-tools-js/issues">
        github.com/OCHA-DAP/topo-tools-js
      </a>
      .
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  :global(body):has(> .masthead) {
    background: var(--hdx-neutral-01);
  }
  .masthead {
    background: var(--hdx-brand-7);
    color: var(--hdx-neutral-0);
  }
  .masthead-inner,
  .page {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .masthead-inner {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem 2.5rem;
  }
  .masthead :global(.masthead-bar) {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .masthead h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .masthead .tagline {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--hdx-brand-05);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
  .page {
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--hdx-neutral-9);
  }
  .page ul {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .page li + li {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
</style>
